cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ARCA in research, publications, or software development, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "ARCA: Asset Representation Conversion Architecture"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
abstract: "ARCA is an open-source BIM-to-GIS conversion engine for IFC, SketchUp (SKP), and ATAP 2.5D GeoJSON models. It generates lightweight GeoJSON LOD 1.3, detailed GLB (glTF 2.0), CityJSON 1.1, and CityGML 2.0 representations, with geometry generalization, semantic surfaces, and spatial referencing."
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23880147"

